  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4dca46f39a84a1663618a430e087d88ac10e3c3e2017cdea8d45b1b476b9b3e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 26 and 29\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 26 + 46 − (__**48 ÷ 4**__) + (**__7 × 3__**) − 29 = 61\n\n⇒ **__26 + 46__** − 12 **__+ 21__** − 29 = 61\n\n⇒ **__93__** **__− 12__****__− 29__** = 61\n\n⇒ 52 = 61\n\nOption 2) 46 and 48\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 29 + 48 − (__**46 ÷ 4**__) + (**__7 × 3__**) − 26 = 61\n\n⇒ __**29 + 48**__ − 11.5 **__+ 21__** − 26 = 61\n\n⇒ __**98**____** − 11.5 − 26**__ = 61\n\n⇒ 60.5 = 61\n\nOption 3) 46 and 26\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 29 + 26 − (**__48 ÷ 4__**) + (**__7 × 3__**) − 46 = 61\n\n⇒ **__29 + 2__****__6__** − 12 __**+ 21**__ − 46 = 61\n\n⇒ **__76__****__ − 12 − 4__****__6__** = 61\n\n⇒ 18 = 61\n\n**Option 4) 4 and 3**\n\n**After interchange the numbers:**\n\n⇒ 29 + 46 − (**__48 ÷ 3__**) + (__**7 × 4**__) − 26 = 61\n\n⇒ **__29 + 46__** − 16 **__+ 28__** − 26 = 61\n\n⇒ __103____** − 16**____** − 26**__ = 61\n\n**⇒ 61 = 61**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
